On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Phew ... So finally the appraisal is done. It took too much time."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's taking longer than I thought to appraise. While you're waiting, please go to [Blacksmith] Heppa of Moradon and receive [Appraisal Tool Set], which I have requested from him not long ago. Then, bring it to me. I guess it'll cost a hundred Noahs, so bring the money. Don't worry. I'll give you the money when you bring the receipt.\n\nAppraisers of Goods Eslant updated rocker's feelings of emotional set of tools and a set of emotional tools bill Moradon of  blacksmith to retrieve a sea wave."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Phew ... So finally the appraisal is done. It took too much time."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's taking longer than I thought to appraise. While you're waiting, please go to [Blacksmith] Heppa of Moradon and receive [Appraisal Tool Set], which I have requested from him not long ago. Then, bring it to me. I guess it'll cost a hundred thousand Noahs, so bring the money. Don't worry. I'll give you the money when you bring the receipt.\n\nEmotional set of tools, the materials and the bill set of emotional tools to help the feelings of Appraisers of Goods Eslant updated Deeds Moradon of  blacksmith to retrieve a sea wave."

On in_progress
