On claimable
    Show quest "You are finally here. So you have managed to set aside all your emotions!\n\nThen, shall we bring it together and search for the next item? The next item is [Brilliant Stone] of [Death Wizard].  Good luck."

On completed
    Say "Then please come back when you reach Lv67. You will only be able to collect the next items then."
